{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fight is coming to your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After boxing with you in VR with ARVIS Punch, and ARVIS Punch 2, our fighters are waiting to reach a bigger audience by removing the need of a headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience a new and dynamic fight experience with our third-person perspective, and brand new animations that really PUNCH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills with all of our classic VR fighters like Mariano, or even Ultratumba; and get ready to face new challengers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your fighter and opponent carefully, as their speed, strength or reflexes can be the difference between a nice fight and a straight Knock Out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still finding our fighters too weak? Jump into multiplayer mode, where you will be able to prove your worth online and locally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So don't waste any time, get into ARVIS Knock Out! Select your fighter, hit the ring, and get that Knock Out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670320?t=1745248288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/86919804967ea77f1741e8cc458fd3e682438339/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745248288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/0a76f49a3b954178137821fd453873f323a50d8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745248288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/0a76f49a3b954178137821fd453873f323a50d8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745248288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fight is coming to your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After boxing with you in VR with ARVIS Punch, and ARVIS Punch 2, our fighters are waiting to reach a bigger audience by removing the need of a headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience a new and dynamic fight experience with our third-person perspective, and brand new animations that really PUNCH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills with all of our classic VR fighters like Mariano, or even Ultratumba; and get ready to face new challengers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your fighter and opponent carefully, as their speed, strength or reflexes can be the difference between a nice fight and a straight Knock Out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still finding our fighters too weak? Jump into multiplayer mode, where you will be able to prove your worth online and locally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So don't waste any time, get into ARVIS Knock Out! Select your fighter, hit the ring, and get that Knock Out!</p>","developers":["Mindfly Studio","Johan Loredo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/45478d425e005a87a1d00dd05c42fed8f8b58a84/header.jpg?t=1745248288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127351,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127351/movie480.mp4?t=1745248286","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127351/movie_max.mp4?t=1745248286"},"name":"Pr